# Post Compose

::summary
The Posts composer in the shell wrapper: one body for every selected platform, live per-platform char counters, toggleable target chips with honest platform gates (gated targets SHOWN inert with reason, never hidden), the media well with transcode state + the platform-requirement hint, the schedule row with a real datetime-local picker and the X cost estimate, and ROLE-AWARE action sets — admin (Save draft / Post now / Schedule) vs member (Save draft / Submit for review). Reached from the queue's New post, the global create fast path, or the hub.
::

