Bluesky
Selected · 300-char limit
::::

::::row[icon=sparkle action=togglePostTarget href=# trailing-label="Off" trailing-action=togglePostTarget]
Fediverse
Off · 500-char limit
::::

::::row[icon=sparkle action=togglePostTarget href=# trailing-label="Off" trailing-action=togglePostTarget]
Forum Network
Off · 40,000-char limit
::::

::::row[icon=sparkle action=togglePostTarget href=# trailing-label="Off" trailing-action=togglePostTarget]
Dev Community
Off · article — no hard limit
::::

::::row[icon=login state=gated href=#]
Photo Network — awaiting network-group review
Gated · inert chip with reason · connects on approval
::::

::::row[icon=login state=gated href=#]
Video Network — draft-only until audit
Gated · inert chip with reason · posts land as private drafts
::::

## Media well

::::row[icon=file state=transcoding href=#]
launch-clip.mp4
TRANSCODING… · per-platform renditions
::::

::::row[icon=file action=openMediaPicker href=#]
Add media
Opens the shared media-picker sheet (modals/media-picker.surf)
::::

Media is transcoded per platform. Photo Network and Video Network require at least one image or video; text-only posts can't target them.

## Schedule + cost

::::toolbar
- text[value="Schedule"]
- dropdown[label="Thu Aug 06, 9:00 AM" options=next-slot|now|pick-date-time action=setPostSchedule]
- text[value="X cost estimate: $0.02 / post"]
::::

"Pick date and time…" reveals a REAL datetime-local input (min = today) and calls showPicker() wrapped in try/catch (unsupported browsers fall back to focus). The picked value rewrites the select's label.

## Actions — role-aware

::::toolbar
- text[value="Admin"]
- spacer
- button[label="Save draft" action=savePostDraft]
- button[label="Post now" action=postNow]
- button[label="Schedule" style=primary action=schedulePost]
::::

::::toolbar
- text[value="Member"]
- spacer
- button[label="Save draft" action=savePostDraft]
- button[label="Submit for review" style=primary action=submitPostForReview]
::::

:::

::

Submit for review notifies admins with a deep link to the post detail. The Admin ⇄ Member toggle in the title row is a design communication device demoing both role states — not shipped chrome (it keeps its labels; role names are the content); shipped, exactly one action row renders per the viewer's workspace role. G3 pass (WP-N3 08-11): the role-aware footer rows keep ALL labels — Schedule and Submit for review are the meaning-carrying primaries, and Save draft / Post now have no unambiguous registry glyph (send reads as message-send), so no label is dropped here.

## Renderer notes (consciously deferred)

- Target chips render as toggled rows; the shipped control is a wrapping pill-chip strip (selected = accent fill, gated = dimmed inert) — `::suggestion-chips` single-select/multi-select gap, deferred to the block round.
- Live per-platform char counters (over-limit turns red) are state layer.
- The datetime-local picker item has no typed vocabulary expression yet (toolbar dropdown emits option lists only) — the dropdown + prose stands in; typed date-time input kind deferred.
- Per-platform body overrides are collapsed behind the counters (out of mockup v1; the port ships them).
- The body form's built-in submit button duplicates the member primary in the role-aware action rows — the form grammar always emits a submit; the shipped composer keeps ONLY the role action row.
